{"ref":"BDB, חֹתֵן","hw":"חֹתֵן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֹתֵן</span></big>  <strong>n.verb. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong> m. wife’s father (</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">خَاتِنٌ</span> <em>a circumciser</em>, hence father-in-law, with ref. to circumcision performed on young men just before marriage; <span dir=\"rtl\">خَتَنٌ</span> <em>relation on wife’s side;</em> v. We<sup>Prol. 1886, 355 Anm. 1; Skizzen iii, 154</sup> Sta<sup>ZAW 1886, 143 Anm.</sup> Nö<sup>ZMG 1886, 187</sup>; otherwise Dl<sup>Pr 91</sup> Lag<sup>BN 116</sup><strong>)</strong>—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹתֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:1\" href=\"/Exodus.18.1\">Ex 18:1</a> + 9 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹתֶנְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:6\" href=\"/Exodus.18.6\">Ex 18:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹתְנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:1\" href=\"/Exodus.3.1\">Ex 3:1</a> + 9 times;—usually of Moses’ <em>wife’s father</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:1\" href=\"/Exodus.3.1\">Ex 3:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:18\" href=\"/Exodus.4.18\">4:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:1\" href=\"/Exodus.18.1\">18:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:2\" href=\"/Exodus.18.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:5\" href=\"/Exodus.18.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:6\" href=\"/Exodus.18.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:7\" href=\"/Exodus.18.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:8\" href=\"/Exodus.18.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:12\" href=\"/Exodus.18.12\">12</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:14\" href=\"/Exodus.18.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:15\" href=\"/Exodus.18.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:17\" href=\"/Exodus.18.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:24\" href=\"/Exodus.18.24\">24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:27\" href=\"/Exodus.18.27\">27</a> (all E), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:29\" href=\"/Numbers.10.29\">Nu 10:29</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:16\" href=\"/Judges.1.16\">Ju 1:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:11\" href=\"/Judges.4.11\">4:11</a>; of a Levite <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:4\" href=\"/Judges.19.4\">Ju 19:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:7\" href=\"/Judges.19.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:9\" href=\"/Judges.19.9\">9</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong> f.</strong> <em>wife’s mother</em>, only sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹתַנְתּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 27:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.27.23\">Dt 27:23</a>.","next":"BDB, חָתָן","prev":"BDB, חתן"}